<div class="container dash">
  <%- include('_nav') %>
  <div class="dash__main">
    <header class="app-head">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Job seeker</p>
        <h1>Job alerts</h1>
        <p class="app-head__context">When a new posting matches your profile you always get an in-app notification. Choose whether we also email you.</p>
      </div>
    </header>

    <form method="post" action="/jobseeker/alerts" class="form" id="alerts">
      <section class="card stack" aria-labelledby="email-h">
        <div class="card__head"><h2 id="email-h" class="h3">Email alerts</h2><span class="badge <%= profile.notify_email ? 'badge--positive' : '' %>"><%= profile.notify_email ? 'On' : 'Off' %></span></div>
        <label class="check switch-row"><input type="checkbox" name="notify_email" value="1" <%= profile.notify_email ? 'checked' : '' %> role="switch" aria-checked="<%= profile.notify_email ? 'true' : 'false' %>" data-switch> <span><strong>Email me when a job matches my profile</strong><br><span class="small muted">Sent to <%= user.email %></span></span></label>
        <fieldset class="field">
          <legend>How often</legend>
          <div class="checks">
            <label class="check check--multi"><input type="radio" name="notify_frequency" value="instant" <%= profile.notify_frequency !== 'daily' ? 'checked' : '' %>> <span><strong>Instantly</strong><br><span class="small muted">One email per matching job, as soon as it goes live</span></span></label>
            <label class="check check--multi"><input type="radio" name="notify_frequency" value="daily" <%= profile.notify_frequency === 'daily' ? 'checked' : '' %>> <span><strong>Daily digest</strong><br><span class="small muted">One email a day listing every new match</span></span></label>
          </div>
        </fieldset>
        <div class="form-actions"><button class="kds-btn kds-btn--accent" type="submit">Save alert settings</button></div>
      </section>
    </form>

    <section class="card stack" aria-labelledby="crit-h">
      <div class="card__head"><h2 id="crit-h" class="h3">Your alert criteria</h2><a class="kds-btn kds-btn--ghost" href="/jobseeker/profile#f-categories">Edit in profile</a></div>
      <p class="small muted">A job matches when it is in one of your categories, mentions one of your keywords (as a whole word — “RN” will not match “learn”), or lists one of your skills — and is in a province you will work in (or is remote). Matches are ranked: category counts most, then keywords, skills, province and whether the employer is hiring for the audience you identified with. Instant alerts go out the moment a posting is paid and live; the daily digest is one email a day covering the previous 24 hours, and is only sent when there is something new.</p>
      <dl class="crit">
        <div><dt>Categories</dt><dd><%= (profile.categories || []).length ? profile.categories.map(h.categoryName).join(', ') : 'Any' %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Keywords</dt><dd><%= (profile.keywords || []).length ? profile.keywords.join(', ') : 'None' %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Skills</dt><dd><%= (profile.skills || []).length ? profile.skills.join(', ') : 'None' %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Provinces</dt><dd><%= (profile.provinces || []).length ? profile.provinces.map(h.provinceName).join(', ') : 'Anywhere in Canada' %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Job types</dt><dd><%= (profile.job_types || []).length ? profile.job_types.map(h.jobTypeName).join(', ') : 'Any' %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>Arrangement</dt><dd><%= (profile.work_arrangements || []).length ? profile.work_arrangements.map(h.workArrangementName).join(', ') : 'Any' %></dd></div>
        <div><dt>I am a…</dt><dd><%= (profile.audiences || []).length ? profile.audiences.map(h.audienceName).join(', ') : 'Not set' %></dd></div>
      </dl>
    </section>
  </div>
</div>
